---
description: Stop instead of guessing the SQL verb from command text
alwaysApply: true
---

# Halt on SQL verb sniffing

Do not inspect command text for the statement kind (`StartsWith("INSERT")`, `/^\s*insert/i`, `eq_ignore_ascii_case("INSERT")`, `Contains("RETURNING")` on the SQL string).

Dispatch on the statement (`InsertStatement`, `Returning`, `SelectInsertedIdStatement`). Native string execute does not invent a verb.
